SUMMARY:November Science Sunday: Butter Churning at the NAS Pensacola Libra
 ry
LOCATION:NAS Pensacola Library\, NAS Pensacola\, Pensacola\, FL 32508
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 11/22 · time not published\n\nThe NAS Pensacola Library
 's November Science Sunday shows how butter is made. A hands-on butter-chu
 rning activity explores emulsification and phase changes. The event is on 
 Sunday\, November 22.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-mwr-november-science-sunday-butter-churning-na
 sp-library-1122.html
