DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261124T180000
SUMMARY:NWFAA Astronomy Workshop at the Crestview Library
LOCATION:Crestview Library\, 1445 Commerce Dr\, Crestview\, FL 32539
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday 11/24 · 5:00 PM to 6:00 PM\n\nThe Northwest Florida As
 tronomical Association runs a monthly workshop in the Crestview Library me
 eting room. The group talks about the objects and events visible in the sk
 y over the next 30 days\, plus recent astronomy news. The workshop support
 s the library's telescope program and is free to all.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDe
 tails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-nwfaa-astronomy-workshop-cre
 stview-1124.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-nwfaa-astronomy-workshop-crestvi
 ew-1124.html
