SUMMARY:Let it Snow planetarium show at Pensacola State College
LOCATION:Pensacola State College Planetarium\, 1000 College Blvd\, Building
  21\, Pensacola\, FL 32504
DESCRIPTION:Friday 12/4 · 6:00 PM to 7:00 PM\n\nLet it Snow: A Holiday Mus
 ical Journey is a 32 minute planetarium program that the college lists for
  all ages. The Pensacola State College calendar schedules a public showing
  on Friday\, December 4 from 6:00 PM to 7:00 PM. The planetarium seats 97 
 people.\n\nPrice: from $4\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/
 ev-psc-let-it-snow-planetarium-1204.html
