DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261205T130000
SUMMARY:Discover Science Saturday: Augmented Reality
LOCATION:Emerald Coast Science Center\, 31 SW Memorial Parkway\, Fort Walto
 n Beach\, FL 32548
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 12/5 · 10:00 AM to 1:00 PM\n\nThe Emerald Coast Scien
 ce Center runs a themed activity morning on the first Saturday of every mo
 nth. December's theme is augmented reality\, with a Merge Cube for 3D holo
 grams\, a paper cube kids build themselves\, and a coloring activity that 
 animates the drawings. Hands-on activities run from 10:00 AM to noon\, the
 n the sciPad area is open to everyone until 1:00 PM. Space is first come\,
  first served\, and an online RSVP does not hold a spot.\n\nPrice: from $1
 3\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-ecsc-discover-science
 -saturday-1205.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-ecsc-discover-science-saturday-1
 205.html
