SUMMARY:GEMS shark lady workshop for girls at the Fort Walton Beach Library
LOCATION:Fort Walton Beach Library\, 185 Miracle Strip Parkway SE\, Fort Wa
 lton Beach\, FL 32548
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 12/12 · 10:30 AM to 12:00 PM\n\nThe Emerald Coast Sci
 ence Center runs a free monthly science workshop for girls ages 8 to 15. D
 ecember's session follows ichthyologist Eugenie Clark\, the Shark Lady. St
 udents learn how sharks adapt to the ocean and play a food web game about 
 shark and ocean conservation. It is a drop-off program\, and pre-registrat
 ion is recommended so there are enough materials.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetail
 s: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-gems-shark-lady-fwb-1212.html
